      "date": "2022-01-20 00:00",
      "title": "As seen on TV :)",
      "author": "juls",
      "excerpt": "Regional Sales Manager Juls Bratton joined Rebecca Petner in the Studio 814 Kitchen in January to show how you can elevate any Marianna’s hoagie.",
